      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَدِىٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَادِيَةٌ</span>: ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  and see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَدْوٌ</span>, in three
