       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  Also, [or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِئْرٌ بَدِىٌّ</span>,] originally <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَدِىْءٌ</span>,
